                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be446d2a-f6e6-3437-a7a0-f6aa893dfb5e",
                        "entry_id": "8bc381cf-2a63-3838-a620-64557aa016b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "hater (someone who engages in online harassment)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "derogatory",
                            "masculine",
                            "neologism",
                            "person"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e39c6cb-7acc-4673-b8e0-8eb730ce30ce",
                                "sense_id": "be446d2a-f6e6-3437-a7a0-f6aa893dfb5e",
                                "text": "Zatem ideologia Do-It-Yourself okazuje się istotna także w wypadku hejterów. „Zrób to sam” jest nawet bardziej wymowne niż w wypadku innych nisz współczesnej kultury. Jeśli jesteś hejterem, to skazany jesteś tylko na siebie.",
                                "translation": "Therefor the Do-It-Yourself ideology turns out to matter, also when it comes to haters. \"Do it yourself\" is even more telling than in other niches of modern culture. If you are a hater, then you are only on your own.",
                                "english": "Therefor the Do-It-Yourself ideology turns out to matter, also when it comes to haters. \"Do it yourself\" is even more telling than in other niches of modern culture. If you are a hater, then you are only on your own."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d40dfbe-fbbe-4772-bc30-158ec6766315",
                                "sense_id": "be446d2a-f6e6-3437-a7a0-f6aa893dfb5e",
                                "text": "• trolle i hejterzy — warto ich wyróżnić, bo spędzają sen z powiek community managerom. Hejterzy nienawidzą i krytykują dla zasady, a trolle mogą podpuszczać, oszukiwać, zadawać głupie pytania itd.",
                                "translation": "• trolls and haters - it's worth it to separate the two, because they keep community managers awake at night.",
                                "english": "• trolls and haters - it's worth it to separate the two, because they keep community managers awake at night."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8817f93-a40f-482a-a2c7-5f06d6e88467",
                                "sense_id": "be446d2a-f6e6-3437-a7a0-f6aa893dfb5e",
                                "text": "W sieci istniały bowiem także fora nienawistników, na których anonimowi hejterzy rozkładali jego powieść na czynniki pierwsze, ośmieszali ją i sugerowali autorowi, [...]",
                                "translation": "Because there existed online a lot of hater forums, where anonymous haters broke down his story into it's most basic parts, they derided it, and the authors suggested that…",
                                "english": "Because there existed online a lot of hater forums, where anonymous haters broke down his story into it's most basic parts, they derided it, and the authors suggested that…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
